        "number": 8,
        "internalPageId": 8,
        "title": "When we talk about life events or arrangements, we normally work in English using the present progressive structure. Check the following examples.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "When we talk about life events or arrangements, we normally work in English using the present progressive structure. Check the following examples.",
          "TO CONSIDER 1. Using the present progressive with future phrases state future events likely to happen. 2. Phrases must state a definite moment mainly.",
          "Be + Ving + Future Phrase We are attending Joe’s wedding this Saturday. Are you attending Joe’s wedding this Saturday? They are graduating from college in some hours. Are they graduating from college in some hours? He is getting married in two days. Is he getting married in two days?"
        ],
